                                "sense_id": "0f3e6e90-1b45-3b66-a280-6ea2d395ea0b",
                                "text": "The announcement Wednesday said those seeking refuge would all now be processed on the island nation of Nauru, another country that has been doing that work for Australia."
                            }
                        ]
